@page "/terms"

<PageTitle>@L["Terms & Conditions · NextGen Coaching"]</PageTitle>

<PageIntro Eyebrow="CLARITY &amp; TRUST" Title="The details, clearly explained." Description="The terms and conditions for learning, enrolling, and using the NextGen platform." Meta="@LastUpdated" />

<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">

    <div>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["These Terms & Conditions (\"Terms\") govern your access to and use of the website, platform, and coaching programmes offered by NextGen Graduate IT Coaching (\"NextGen\", \"we\", \"us\"). By creating an account, enrolling in a programme, or otherwise using our services, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the platform."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["1. Eligibility & accounts"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["You must provide accurate information when creating an account and keep it up to date. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials and for all activity under your account. Notify us promptly of any unauthorised use."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["2. Programmes & enrolment"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["Enrolment in a programme is confirmed upon successful payment and allocation to a batch. Programme content, schedules, instructors, and batch timings may change for operational reasons; we will make reasonable efforts to communicate material changes in advance."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["3. Fees, payments & invoices"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["Fees are displayed at the point of enrolment and are payable through our payment gateway (Razorpay). All fees are in Indian Rupees and inclusive or exclusive of taxes as indicated at checkout. An invoice is generated for each successful payment and is available in your account."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["4. Refunds & cancellations"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["Refund eligibility depends on the programme and the time elapsed since enrolment, as described in the refund schedule communicated at the time of purchase. Approved refunds are processed to the original payment method. Replace this clause with your finalised, programme-specific refund policy before launch."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["5. Placement & career support"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["We provide placement assistance, including resume reviews, mock interviews, and introductions to hiring partners. Placement assistance is a best-effort service and does not constitute a guarantee of employment, a specific salary, or a specific role. Outcomes depend on your performance, market conditions, and partner requirements."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["6. Acceptable use"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-2">@L["You agree not to:"]</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-text-secondary space-y-1">
            <li>@L["share, resell, or redistribute course materials, recordings, or assessments;"]</li>
            <li>@L["misrepresent your identity or submit work that is not your own;"]</li>
            <li>@L["attempt to disrupt, reverse-engineer, or gain unauthorised access to the platform; or"]</li>
            <li>@L["use the platform for any unlawful purpose."]</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mt-2">@L["We may suspend or terminate accounts that breach these Terms."]</p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["7. Intellectual property"]</h2>
