            @L["All course content, materials, branding, and platform software are owned by NextGen or its licensors and are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws. You receive a limited, non-transferable licence to access materials for your personal learning during your enrolment."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["8. Your content"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["You retain ownership of the assignments, projects, and resumes you submit. You grant us a licence to store and process this content for the purpose of delivering the programme, grading, and placement support."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["9. Limitation of liability"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["To the maximum extent permitted by law, NextGen is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the platform. Our total liability for any claim is limited to the fees you paid for the relevant programme."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["10. Governing law & disputes"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Any disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts at [your city], India. Insert your registered place of business before launch."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["11. Changes to these Terms"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["We may revise these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the platform after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms."]
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card p-6">
        <h2 class="text-h2 mb-3">@L["Contact"]</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
            @L["Questions about these Terms? Reach us via our"]
            <a class="text-brand-primary hover:underline" href="/contact">@L["contact page"]</a> @L["or email"]
            <a class="text-brand-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:support@nextgencoaching.example">support@nextgencoaching.example</a>.
        </p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-caption text-text-muted">
        @L["This page is a starting template and should be reviewed by qualified legal counsel before public launch. Finalise the refund policy, governing-law city, and contact details, and replace the placeholder text in brackets."]
    </p>

</section>

@code {
    private const string LastUpdated = "27 June 2026";
}

